<title>USA: Rush Enterprises names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Rush Enterprises names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rush Enterprises Inc said on Tuesday it named Martin Naegelin Jr. as vice president and chief financial officer, replacing D. Jeffery Michell who resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>Before joining Rush, Naegelin worked for Norwood Promotional Products Inc as vice president of investor relations and corporate development, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
